# MiniMax H3 prompt presets — one env file for this entire prompt category
H3_PRESET_FAMILY="constraints_and_technical_rules"
H3_PRESETS_JSON={"Anatomy Lock":"Maintain realistic body proportions, joint articulation, limb count, gait, balance and contact with the ground.","Audio Continuity":"Maintain continuous ambience, room tone and sound perspective across shots without pops, abrupt level changes or unexplained silence.","Brand-Safe Output":"Avoid unrelated brands, competitor marks, offensive content, unsafe behavior and misleading product functionality.","Camera Discipline":"Use only the specified camera path, speed and amplitude; prevent accidental zoom, shake, horizon roll and framing drift.","Clean Delivery":"Do not generate borders, mattes, split screens, UI chrome, debug overlays, compression artifacts or unfinished frames.","Clothing Lock":"Keep every garment fitted to the same body area with stable color, pattern, seams, hem length, layering and realistic fabric physics.","Color Lock":"Preserve established product, wardrobe, skin and environment colors without hue drift, flashing or unmotivated grading changes.","Environment Lock":"Preserve environment layout, horizon, architecture, surfaces, lighting direction, background depth and geographic continuity.","Exact Text":"Preserve supplied visible wording exactly, including spelling, case, line order, placement and timing; do not add any other text.","Face Detail":"Maintain stable eyes, nose, mouth, teeth, ears and facial symmetry; prevent face drift, beautification drift and expression flicker.","Full-Body Lock":"Keep the complete head, hair, arms, hands, torso, legs, ankles and both feet inside frame with visible space above and below.","Geometry Lock":"Keep object geometry, straight lines, symmetry, perspective and structural connections stable across the sequence.","Hand Accuracy":"Maintain anatomically correct hands and fingers with believable grip, contact, occlusion and object interaction.","Identity Lock":"Preserve one consistent subject identity, facial structure, apparent age, hairstyle, skin appearance and recognizable features in every frame.","Lighting Lock":"Maintain one coherent lighting direction, exposure, shadow softness, reflections and color temperature throughout.","Lip-Sync Lock":"Synchronize visible mouth shapes precisely to the supplied dialogue while preserving the exact words, speaker identity and natural pauses.","Logo Stability":"Keep existing small product marks in their original placement and proportions; never invent, enlarge, duplicate or rewrite logos.","Material Fidelity":"Preserve material roughness, gloss, translucency, weave, stitching, metal response and surface imperfections consistently.","Maximum Consistency":"Prioritize identity, anatomy, wardrobe, product, environment and lighting consistency over elaborate camera motion or small detail reveals.","Minimal Change":"Modify only the explicitly requested attributes and preserve all other referenced content and continuity unchanged.","Motion Discipline":"Keep movement smooth, physically motivated and continuous; prevent teleportation, sliding feet, sudden speed changes and pose snapping.","No Close-Ups":"Do not use face-only, bust, waist-up, product-only, macro or extreme close-up framing.","No Extra Objects":"Do not introduce unrelated props, accessories, vehicles, animals, furniture or environmental decorations.","No Generated Text":"Do not generate captions, subtitles, labels, banners, interface elements, watermarks or new readable text.","Physical Contact":"Preserve accurate contact points, grip, weight, friction, gravity, momentum and collision response between subjects and objects.","Product Lock":"Preserve exactly one product instance with unchanged shape, proportions, color, material, hardware, construction and recognizable design.","Remove Background People":"Remove all people inherited from environment references and prevent new background pedestrians, players or crowds from appearing.","Safe Frame Boundary":"Keep important faces, hands, products, feet and text away from frame edges and prevent accidental cropping.","Scale Lock":"Keep realistic and constant scale relationships between people, products, props and the environment.","Single Continuous Take":"Use one continuous take with no cuts, transitions, angle jumps, time jumps or discontinuous camera repositioning.","Single Subject":"Show exactly one main subject; do not duplicate, replace, merge or introduce additional people or reflections that resemble another subject.","Temporal Stability":"Prevent flicker, texture crawling, color pulsing, object popping, identity drift and frame-to-frame design changes."}
